{"type":"message","id":"995fe75f","parentId":"f6a4e4d0","timestamp":"2026-07-14T18:46:47.847Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-e13a6c29-dff4-4cfc-a130-b3f75f904b31","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### MONTY (Chief of Staff & Central Boardroom Orchestrator)\r\n### CHARLIE (Coding Lead & Systems Engineer)\r\n### TESS (Quant Analyst & Risk Officer)\r\n### ROXY (UI/UX & Creative Director)\r\n### JACK (Backend Infrastructure Engineer)\r\n### JARVIS (Environment Automation & System Health)\r\n### PAPERCLIP (Context Optimization Engine)\r\n### OBSIDIAN_SCRIBE (Knowledge-Graph Synchronization)\r\n### ALGO_CORE_01 - 08 (Execution Fleet)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":269,"aggregated":"### MONTY (Chief of Staff & Central Boardroom Orchestrator)\r\n### CHARLIE (Coding Lead & Systems Engineer)\r\n### TESS (Quant Analyst & Risk Officer)\r\n### ROXY (UI/UX & Creative Director)\r\n### JACK (Backend Infrastructure Engineer)\r\n### JARVIS (Environment Automation & System Health)\r\n### PAPERCLIP (Context Optimization Engine)\r\n### OBSIDIAN_SCRIBE (Knowledge-Graph Synchronization)\r\n### ALGO_CORE_01 - 08 (Execution Fleet)","cwd":"C:\\Warlord_Inc\\Warlord_WASP\\.openclaw\\.openclaw\\workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1784054807839}}
