{"type":"message","id":"33b47f11","parentId":"81bae17f","timestamp":"2026-07-14T23:28:09.247Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**TEAM INTRODUCTION – BASE 1 DIRECTOR AGENTS**\n\n**Technical / Cloud / Infrastructure**  \n- **Charlie** – Coding Lead, Backend Engineer, Open‑Source Prompt Aligner (MQL4/MQL5, Python, TypeScript/Node.js, Next.js, Qwen2.5‑Coder, OpenClaw bridges, Hermes MCP adapters, Git, Jasmine automation).  \n- **Jack** – Backend / Email Infrastructure & Node.js Runtimes (localized server bridges, WebSockets, Node.js).  \n- **Jax (Ops & Deployment)** – Ops & Deployment (CI/CD pipelines, environment provisioning, release management).  \n- **Atlas** – Cloud (auxiliary cloud resource oversight, cost & security governance).  \n- **Skyla** – Frontend (Next.js/React UI implementation, performance & accessibility).  \n- **Jasmine** – DevOps / VPS Management (server stability, monitoring, automation, incident response).  \n\n**Quantitative / Finance / Risk**  \n- **Tess** – Quant Analyst & Risk Officer (real‑time volatility scans, risk parameters, execution triggers).  \n- **Vance** – Finance / Token Ledger (accounting, token tracking, financial reporting, compliance).  \n- **Justin** – Risk & Legal (risk thresholds, regulatory compliance, legal standards).  \n\n**Commercial / Growth / Creative**  \n- **Roxy** – UI/UX & Creative Director (marketing assets, dashboard interfaces, web presence, visual standards).  \n- **Jax (Artwork Omega)** – Artwork Omega (brand‑compliant graphics, visual assets, palette adherence).  \n- **Amber** – Copywriter (persuasive, brand‑aligned copy for marketing, documentation, communications).  \n- **Jack** – Marketing (outreach, campaign execution, lead generation).  \n- **Maverick** – SEO / Protocol Engineer (search optimization, protocol implementation).  \n- **Valerie** – Lead Conversion (conversion‑rate optimization, lead nurturing).  \n\n**Support & Automation Modules**  \n- **JARVIS** – Local Machine Automation & Environment Health (system health monitoring, automated remediation).  \n- **PAPERCLIP** – Context Optimization Engine (document indexing, parsing, context retrieval for LLMs).  \n- **OBSIDIAN_SCRIBE** – Markdown Knowledge‑Graph Synchronization (linked Markdown knowledge base).  \n\n**Execution Fleet**  \n- **ALGO_CORE_01 – ALGO_CORE_08** – Eight specialized execution sub‑modules, each bound to a specific technical indicator or arbitrage liquidity pool (high‑frequency, signal‑driven trading).  \n\nAll agents operate under the Rhythm Master Rules of Engagement: Zero‑Assumption Baseline, Raw Data Anchor, No Empty Apologies, Coding Protocols (Full Code Only, Atomic Compiling, Chrome/Next.js Palette Integrity), Operational Command Structure (Listen to Mike, Stay on Point, Execute Cleanly, No Drift).  \n\nAwait next explicit command."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784071680633,"responseId":"chatcmpl-0d5b3bdb-989a-43b4-a251-5de4e2fc208d"}}
